---
import site from "../data/site.json";
import { asset } from "../data/paths";
---

<section
  id="media-description"
  class="media-description"
  aria-labelledby="media-heading"
>
  <p class="eyebrow">Recorded by our team</p>
  <h2 id="media-heading">Video descriptions & sources</h2>
  <p>
    Videos play silently at original speed when visible, unless reduced motion
    or data saving is enabled. Use the visible “Pause videos” control to stop
    playback. A manual pause is remembered when scrolling. All videos are
    presented without audio, at their original playback speed. The title appears
    above complete video frames. Larger screens show the field and laboratory
    footage side by side; phone layouts stack them.
  </p>
  <section aria-labelledby="field-media-title">
    <h3 id="field-media-title">Roofing fieldwork</h3>
    <p>{site.contextCredit}</p>
    <div id="field-visual-description">
      {site.contextDetails.map((text) => <p>{text}</p>)}
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">{site.contextLicense}</p>
    <div class="media-downloads">
      <a href={asset(site.contextVideo)} download
        >Download the silent field video (MP4)</a
      ><a href={asset(site.contextTrack)} download
        >Field video descriptions (WebVTT)</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="robot-media-title">
    <h3 id="robot-media-title">G1 title video</h3>
    <p id="robot-visual-description">{site.robotHero.description}</p>
    <p class="fine-print">
      Source: the authors’ laboratory recording, <code
        >bending_real_test_20260905_185804_260763_nailgun.mp4</code
      >. The source file is preserved unchanged.
    </p>
    <div class="media-downloads">
      <a href={asset(site.robotHero.video)} download
        >Download the silent G1 excerpt (MP4)</a
      ><a href={asset(site.robotHero.track)} download
        >G1 excerpt descriptions (WebVTT)</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="highlights-media-title">
    <h3 id="highlights-media-title">G1 experiment highlights</h3>
    <p id="highlights-visual-description">{site.robotHighlights.description}</p>
    <ul class="clip-sources">
      <li>Incline walking: <code>roofer_real_upwalk.MOV</code>.</li>
      <li>Stepping and bending with a tool: the nailgun recording above.</li>
      <li>Bending toward the roof surface: <code>hammer.mp4</code>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="fine-print">
      Hard cuts separate independent recordings. Each segment has a visible
      label; the source frame is fitted below the top label without cropping.
      The videos illustrate the experimental setting and movements; the paper’s
      quantitative trials are reported separately in Table 6.
    </p>
    <div class="media-downloads">
      <a href={asset(site.robotHighlights.video)} download
        >Download G1 highlights (MP4)</a
      ><a href={asset(site.robotHighlights.track)} download
        >G1 highlights descriptions (WebVTT)</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
